op: StringPad length at 16777217
in: int:16777217
out: value: f64:0x4170000010000000
class: impl-defined
per-engine.broiler-vm: error: RangeError
prov: spec:es2026@0248456c#sec-stringpad ref:textref@1
script: "x".padStart(16777217).length
note: A string past an engine's own limit may be refused. Broiler.VM's string ceiling (StringLengthCeiling, 2^24 code units), its policy under JSD-0070 decision 4: a string past it is refused with RangeError.
since: 10

id: text/pad-order/0001
